{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42775","headline":"再见从弟舍人 · 刘兼","name":"再见从弟舍人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"屈指依稀十五年，鸾台秘阁位相悬。\n分飞淮甸雁行断，重见江楼蟾影圆。\n滞迹未偕朝北阙，高才方命入西川。\n愿君通理须还早，拜庆慈亲几杖前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘兼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42775.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42775","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}